/* Views (docs/ui/AUTHORING.md "Views"). The runtime registers nui-view: one
   textured quad over its content box, drawn from a C++ view provider's
   render target (the minimap, the atlas); its size is the provider's
   natural size unless the sheet gives one.

   <nui-view name="minimap" class="nui-interactive"/>
   	hover="label" (the default) shows the provider's hover text in its own
   	child, div.nui-view__label, right-aligned 5dp left of the pointer, its
   	color the provider's; an image (a guild mark) shows first, in
   	img.nui-view__mark. hover="none" shows none.

   The label is text the game wrote, shown as written. It takes no pointer,
   so it never covers the view's hover. */

nui-view
{
	display: block;
}
.nui-view__label
{
	position: absolute;
	white-space: nowrap;
	font-size: var(--font-sm);
	font-effect: outline(1dp var(--text-outline));
	pointer-events: none;
}
.nui-view__mark
{
	display: inline-block;
	width: 16dp;
	height: 12dp;
	margin-right: 2dp;
}
